# Copy to $MINDFORGE_STATE/scope.txt (default ~/.claude/state/scope.txt). Private: never commit it.
# mindforge wrap checks every vault note changed in the session against it, and
# `mindforge scrub --vault` checks the whole vault (#23).
#
# One line per name: <term> TAB <path part>|<path part>|...
# The term is fine only in a note whose path contains one of the parts
# (case-insensitive). A note that is fine where it is (one that talks ABOUT the
# rule, say) can be added as its own part.
#
# Example: a persona name that belongs to two projects only
# Aldric	My-Novel|The-Game
